  <data name="TitleGameMode.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Game / Performance Mode</value></data>
  <data name="SubtitleGameMode.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Switches the real Windows power plan to High performance and turns on Windows' own Game Mode setting while active — the same settings available in Power Options and the Settings app. No invented FPS or performance numbers are shown; Windows exposes none honestly.</value></data>
